;SHEET
THE SHEETS PRESENTED AS *ACT* AND *BCT* ON SHEET RECORDS
BELOW ARE ACTUALLY EIGHT-STRANDED BETA-BARRELS.  THIS IS
REPRESENTED BY A NINE-STRANDED SHEET IN WHICH THE FIRST AND
LAST STRANDS ARE IDENTICAL.
;
